{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-soho-square","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"soho-square-bloom-holding-al-saadiyat-island","about":"Soho Square - a residential development by Bloom Holding consisting of two residential buildings located in the centre of Saadiyat - Abu Dhabi, within walking distance to all necessary infrastructure. The complex has 10 floors and offers apartments with 1-4 bedrooms. This project is based on the ideas of comfortable and energetic living, which harmonises with the general urban structure.The apartments are designed with an open-plan layout, equipped with first-class appliances and finishes that give them a modern and stylish look.Soho Square Residences offer an impressive array of amenities including high-end finishes, swimming pools, landscaped gardens and a state-of-the-art fitness centre. Residents can enjoy a sophisticated and indulgent lifestyle.Soho Square properties feature panoramic windows and modern minimalist interior design. The interior finishes utilise calm light tones that, together with natural light, create visual spaciousness. Most residences have spacious outdoor terraces, some with bay views.The city's main attractions are only a short walk away, providing ample access to entertainment, shopping and other leisure facilities. Zayed National Museum, Saadiyat Beach, Manarat Al Saadiyat and Louvre Abu Dhabi are a 10-minute drive away, while Mangrove Park, Guggenheim Abu Dhabi and Hidd Al Saadiyat Marina can be reached in 15 minutes' drive.","price":1580000,"title":"Soho Square","bitrix":{"id":593,"pf_id":"are.2.2006","source":null,"project_id":"Soho Square","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Soho Square","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Bloom Holding","project_location":"Saadiyat Island"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/602/images/2023/12/11/340x252/7aisPXg2w7aT6E1GZIURGLBJLz